silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_03_embedded_engine_functors_sections_02_functor_preservation_laws_concrete_anchor_mapped_obj silm:hasLongDescription "The MappedMittensObject is F(X) is the mapped target object — the image of VetRecord_Mittens under the functor. In the embedded engine context, F(VetRecord_Mittens) is the engine's internal representation of the vet record with the aboutness arrow preserved." .
